body:
Is this comment correct? I think `extend` variants are usually applied after the main configuration setting. In other words,  you should be able both to replace `allow-magic-values` and then `extend` it, just like this pseudo Rust code:

```rust
let mut allow_magic_values = default_magic_values();
if let Some(extend_allowed_magic_values) = config.extend_allowed_magic_values {
    allow_magic_values.extend(extend_allowed_magic_values);
}
```

